---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/brand';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy policy draft"
  path="/privacy"
  description={`A draft privacy policy for ${SITE.name}, including email marketing, order details, Stripe payments, and contact information.`}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 md:py-16">
    <div class="rounded-panel border border-wine/10 bg-cream/80 px-6 py-10 shadow-panel sm:px-10 md:px-14 md:py-14">
      <p class="eyebrow">Policy draft</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl leading-tight text-wine sm:text-5xl">Privacy policy.</h1>
      <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-wine/15 bg-blush/45 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/80">
        This draft is not legal advice. Please review and adapt these terms.
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 max-w-[68ch] space-y-9 text-base leading-8 text-ink/80">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink">Information collected</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            {SITE.name} collects an email address when someone joins the marketing list. When a customer
            places an order, order and shipping details are collected through Stripe so the purchase can
            be processed and shipped.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Payment card information is handled by Stripe. This site does not store payment card data.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            The site also uses browser storage on the customer’s device to remember bag contents and
            whether the welcome offer has already been shown.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink">How information is used</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Order and shipping details are used to process purchases, fulfill orders, share tracking
            information, provide customer support, and keep order records. Marketing email addresses are
            used to share store news, product drops, styling notes, and offers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink">Service providers</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Stripe processes payments and related order information. The store’s email provider processes
            subscriber email addresses for marketing delivery. These providers handle information for the
            services they provide to the store.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink">Marketing choices</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            To opt out of marketing messages, use the unsubscribe option in a marketing email or contact
            <a class="font-bold text-wine underline underline-offset-4" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>
              {SITE.email}
            </a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink">Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Questions about this privacy draft can be sent to
            <a class="font-bold text-wine underline underline-offset-4" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>
              {SITE.email}
            </a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
